  "requirements": {
    "singleton_sieve": "IsSheafFor1012 requires actual member arrow plus separated comparison squares for every other sieve arrow; supplied by genuine original pullback covers.",
    "finest_topology": "Canonical54 requires sheaf condition on every pullback sieve. Both open and fppf sieve modules establish this explicitly, before family transitivity.",
    "cover_size": "Pretopology79 supplies a small genuine covering family inside every covering sieve. Full original coproduct is formed on this index set, not a finite approximation.",
    "relative_sieves": "Over uses actual sieve order equivalence; membership of any original relative arrow is detected on its underlying scheme map.",
    "group_sheaf": "Sheaf716 requires actual group limits and forgetful preservation/reflection. Existing CommGrpCat limit imports provide these, with the original underlying-type presheaf."
  },
